      <guid>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-353/learning-paths/1e2a8e46-937c-47ea-ab43-5716e3bcab2e/exoscale-101/starter/products/overview/overview/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;iaas&#34; class=&#34;heading-link&#34;&gt;&#xA;  IaaS+&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#iaas&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink to this heading&#34;&gt;🔗&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Infrastructure as a Service is the cloud service model we support with the Exoscale platform and a bit more, hence, IaaS+.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;md__image&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&#34;[341 270 162 423 211 97]&#34; src=&#34;iaas-arch.png&#34; onclick=&#34;openModal(this.id)&#34; alt=&#34;iaas-arch&#34; &#xA;  class=&#34;md-image-responsive&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;platform&#34; class=&#34;heading-link&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Platform&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#platform&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink to this heading&#34;&gt;🔗&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A state-of-the-art IaaS platform providing the building blocks for your application infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;md__image&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;img id=&#34;[136 285 125 339 30 123]&#34; src=&#34;iaas-over.png&#34; onclick=&#34;openModal(this.id)&#34; alt=&#34;iaas-over&#34; &#xA;  class=&#34;md-image-responsive&#34; /&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The following questions arise if you think about the breadth of the cloud offerings in the market today:&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Storage</title>
      <link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-353/learning-paths/1e2a8e46-937c-47ea-ab43-5716e3bcab2e/exoscale-101/starter/products/storage/storage/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-353/learning-paths/1e2a8e46-937c-47ea-ab43-5716e3bcab2e/exoscale-101/starter/products/storage/storage/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;object-storage&#34; class=&#34;heading-link&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Object Storage&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#object-storage&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink to this heading&#34;&gt;🔗&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Exoscale&amp;rsquo;s Simple Object Storage (SOS) is a scalable and cost-effective solution for storing and managing large amounts of data. It offers highly available multi-redundancy storage, ensuring data safety and accessibility. You can store various files and objects, such as assets, backups, and media files. Your data remains in the exact location you store it, and Exoscale replicates it in at least three physical copies for maximum safety.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Organization</title>
      <link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-353/learning-paths/1e2a8e46-937c-47ea-ab43-5716e3bcab2e/exoscale-101/starter/products/organisation/organisation/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-353/learning-paths/1e2a8e46-937c-47ea-ab43-5716e3bcab2e/exoscale-101/starter/products/organisation/organisation/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;overview&#34; class=&#34;heading-link&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Overview&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#overview&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink to this heading&#34;&gt;🔗&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In this section of the Portal, you find:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Billing&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Credit Cards&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Invoices&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Subscriptions&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Audit-Trail&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Quotas&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Legal&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h3 id=&#34;billing-info&#34; class=&#34;heading-link&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Billing Info&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#billing-info&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink to this heading&#34;&gt;🔗&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Billing Details&lt;/strong&gt;&#xA;The organization display name is used for invoices. It must be between 4 and 225 characters, cannot be composed of only numbers, and cannot be a UUID. It is not currently possible to modify the country associated with your organization. Please contact support if you need assistance. It is not currently possible to modify your organization&amp;rsquo;s VAT number.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>Support</title>
      <link>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-353/learning-paths/1e2a8e46-937c-47ea-ab43-5716e3bcab2e/exoscale-101/starter/products/support/support/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>https://layer5io.github.io/exoscale-academy/pr-preview/pr-353/learning-paths/1e2a8e46-937c-47ea-ab43-5716e3bcab2e/exoscale-101/starter/products/support/support/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h3 id=&#34;details&#34; class=&#34;heading-link&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Details&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#details&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink to this heading&#34;&gt;🔗&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h3&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;In this section of the Portal, you can view and manage your support tickets by status (&lt;strong&gt;All&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;New&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Waiting&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Open&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Closed&lt;/strong&gt;). Exoscale’s support services are designed to cater to various customer needs, from developers and testers to enterprises running critical workloads. Here&amp;rsquo;s a breakdown of what each support plan includes:&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h4 id=&#34;built-in-support&#34; class=&#34;heading-link&#34;&gt;&#xA;  Built-In Support&#xA;  &lt;a href=&#34;#built-in-support&#34; class=&#34;heading-anchor&#34; aria-label=&#34;Permalink to this heading&#34;&gt;🔗&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;&lt;/h4&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Built-In Support&lt;/strong&gt; is included for all customers at no additional cost. It is ideal for testers, developers, and non-critical applications.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
